window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/owner-resources/b470-c6256c04d6f629d2.json"]={sha256:"c6256c04d6f629d2cc35e0ab098d9727110f53a4260473f1bae48b73f943468b",value:{"sources":[{"id":"b-src-environment","title":"Research on Innovative and Alternative Wastewater Technologies","url":"https://www.epa.gov/sustainable-water-infrastructure/research-innovative-and-alternative-wastewater-technologies","publisher":"U.S. Environmental Protection Agency","scope":"Category overview: wastewater technologies and treatment references. Not individual verification of every named environmental project."},{"id":"b-src-waste","title":"Sustainable Materials Management","url":"https://www.epa.gov/smm","publisher":"U.S. Environmental Protection Agency","scope":"Category overview: materials life cycles, waste prevention, recycling and recovery."},{"id":"b-src-wastewater","title":"Wastewater Technology Fact Sheets","url":"https://www.epa.gov/septic/wastewater-technology-fact-sheets","publisher":"U.S. Environmental Protection Agency","scope":"Category overview: disinfection, constructed wetlands, package plants, sewer technologies and treatment."},{"id":"v17s-urban-flotation","title":"廢紙浮選脫墨","titleEn":"Flotation","url":"https://www.voith.com/corp-en/papermaking___flotation.html","organization":"Voith","accessed":"2026-10-23","publisher":"Voith","scope":"來源支持原理或工程背景；算例為明示教學假設。","scopeEn":"Source supports principles or project context; examples use explicit teaching assumptions."},{"id":"v17s-urban-dip","title":"廢紙回收製漿流程","titleEn":"BlueLine DIP-process","url":"https://www.voith.com/corp-en/papermaking/blueline-dip-process.html","organization":"Voith","accessed":"2026-10-23","publisher":"Voith","scope":"來源支持原理或工程背景；算例為明示教學假設。","scopeEn":"Source supports principles or project context; examples use explicit teaching assumptions."}],"media":{"courses":[{"courseId":"b470","videos":[],"guides":[{"id":"b470-v17-practice","title":"工程操作與定量驗證手冊","titleEn":"Engineering actions and quantitative verification","concept":"以「纖維解離、油墨浮選與水循環」為主線，依序完成十個專題單元。學徒在場景中辨識設備、列出邊界、重算明示的教學算例、比較量測與模型，最後診斷故障並交付證據。每一單元保留機制、算例、驗證與失效四種學習任務。","conceptEn":"Follow fiber liberation, ink flotation and water circulation through ten technical units. Identify equipment in the scene, define boundaries, reproduce explicitly hypothetical examples, compare measurements with models, and diagnose faults before handing over evidence. Each unit contains mechanism, calculation, verification and failure tasks.","procedure":["在「進料乾纖維基準」的教學模型或試算表中先重現 900 kg，再依驗證任務改動一個輸入、保留其餘條件。對照「以濕重計產率會把水分當纖維。」的異常情境，提交基準與變更後數值、單位及一項能區分兩者的量測。","在「碎漿濃度」的教學模型或試算表中先重現 0.06 fraction，再依驗證任務改動一個輸入、保留其餘條件。對照「將百分濃度直接代入分率公式會差100倍。」的異常情境，提交基準與變更後數值、單位及一項能區分兩者的量測。","在「解離能量與纖維保護」的教學模型或試算表中先重現 100 kWh/tonne dry，再依驗證任務改動一個輸入、保留其餘條件。對照「只追求無紙片可能犧牲纖維強度。」的異常情境，提交基準與變更後數值、單位及一項能區分兩者的量測。","在「粗篩與黏著污染」的教學模型或試算表中先重現 36 kg，再依驗證任務改動一個輸入、保留其餘條件。對照「排渣率提高可能增加纖維損失而非只去雜質。」的異常情境，提交基準與變更後數值、單位及一項能區分兩者的量測。","在「油墨疏水性與氣泡」的教學模型或試算表中先重現 6000 m2/m3，再依驗證任務改動一個輸入、保留其餘條件。對照「氣泡過小並非無條件更好，可能增加水與纖維夾帶。」的異常情境，提交基準與變更後數值、單位及一項能區分兩者的量測。","在「油墨去除與有效速率」的教學模型或試算表中先重現 0.301194 fraction，再依驗證任務改動一個輸入、保留其餘條件。對照「沿用不同油墨的k會錯估去除。」的異常情境，提交基準與變更後數值、單位及一項能區分兩者的量測。","在「浮渣纖維損失」的教學模型或試算表中先重現 0.95 fraction，再依驗證任務改動一個輸入、保留其餘條件。對照「將所有浮渣都當油墨會高估選擇性。」的異常情境，提交基準與變更後數值、單位及一項能區分兩者的量測。","在「洗滌濃縮與水耗」的教學模型或試算表中先重現 3 m3/h，再依驗證任務改動一個輸入、保留其餘條件。對照「只降低新水量可能使溶解污染累積。」的異常情境，提交基準與變更後數值、單位及一項能區分兩者的量測。","在「白度與殘墨」的教學模型或試算表中先重現 8 instrument units，再依驗證任務改動一個輸入、保留其餘條件。對照「漂白變亮不代表所有油墨已被分離。」的異常情境，提交基準與變更後數值、單位及一項能區分兩者的量測。","在「總收率與流程最佳化」的教學模型或試算表中先重現 0.89376 fraction，再依驗證任務改動一個輸入、保留其餘條件。對照「只最佳化一段可能把負擔轉移到後段。」的異常情境，提交基準與變更後數值、單位及一項能區分兩者的量測。"],"procedureEn":["In the teaching model or spreadsheet for dry-fiber feed basis, first reproduce 900 kg, then vary one input following the verification task while holding other conditions fixed. Contrast the fault scenario \"Wet-mass yield counts water as fiber.\" and submit baseline and changed values, units, and one measurement that distinguishes them.","In the teaching model or spreadsheet for pulping consistency, first reproduce 0.06 fraction, then vary one input following the verification task while holding other conditions fixed. Contrast the fault scenario \"Using percent as fraction introduces a hundredfold error.\" and submit baseline and changed values, units, and one measurement that distinguishes them.","In the teaching model or spreadsheet for liberation energy and fiber protection, first reproduce 100 kWh/tonne dry, then vary one input following the verification task while holding other conditions fixed. Contrast the fault scenario \"Eliminating every flake may sacrifice fiber strength.\" and submit baseline and changed values, units, and one measurement that distinguishes them.","In the teaching model or spreadsheet for coarse screening and stickies, first reproduce 36 kg, then vary one input following the verification task while holding other conditions fixed. Contrast the fault scenario \"More rejects can mean more fiber loss, not just contaminant removal.\" and submit baseline and changed values, units, and one measurement that distinguishes them.","In the teaching model or spreadsheet for ink hydrophobicity and bubbles, first reproduce 6000 m2/m3, then vary one input following the verification task while holding other conditions fixed. Contrast the fault scenario \"Smaller bubbles are not unconditionally better and may increase entrainment.\" and submit baseline and changed values, units, and one measurement that distinguishes them.","In the teaching model or spreadsheet for ink removal and effective rate, first reproduce 0.301194 fraction, then vary one input following the verification task while holding other conditions fixed. Contrast the fault scenario \"Using k from another ink misestimates removal.\" and submit baseline and changed values, units, and one measurement that distinguishes them.","In the teaching model or spreadsheet for fiber loss in froth, first reproduce 0.95 fraction, then vary one input following the verification task while holding other conditions fixed. Contrast the fault scenario \"Treating all froth solids as ink overstates selectivity.\" and submit baseline and changed values, units, and one measurement that distinguishes them.","In the teaching model or spreadsheet for washing, thickening and water use, first reproduce 3 m3/h, then vary one input following the verification task while holding other conditions fixed. Contrast the fault scenario \"Lower freshwater alone can accumulate dissolved contaminants.\" and submit baseline and changed values, units, and one measurement that distinguishes them.","In the teaching model or spreadsheet for brightness and residual ink, first reproduce 8 instrument units, then vary one input following the verification task while holding other conditions fixed. Contrast the fault scenario \"Brighter bleaching does not mean ink has been physically separated.\" and submit baseline and changed values, units, and one measurement that distinguishes them.","In the teaching model or spreadsheet for overall yield and process optimization, first reproduce 0.89376 fraction, then vary one input following the verification task while holding other conditions fixed. Contrast the fault scenario \"Optimizing one stage can shift the burden downstream.\" and submit baseline and changed values, units, and one measurement that distinguishes them."],"evidence":["比較含水10%與20%的同重進料。","保持乾纖維量，增加水量比較濃度。","比較兩種處理時間下未解離片與纖維長度。","比較排渣中的纖維與塑膠比例。","比較兩種氣泡尺寸並討論表面積與夾帶。","在相同進料改變氣量，重新估計k。","秤量浮渣乾固體並分析其中纖維。","比較開放與閉合水循環的導電度和白度。","對同一樣品同時測白度、殘墨與抗張強度。","將某段收率提高但品質下降的情境納入比較。"],"evidenceEn":["Compare equal wet feed at10% and20% moisture.","Keep dry fiber fixed and add water to compare consistency.","Compare unliberated flakes and fiber length at two durations.","Compare fiber and plastic fractions in rejects.","Compare two bubble sizes and discuss area and entrainment.","Vary air at fixed feed and re-estimate k.","Weigh dry froth solids and determine fiber content.","Compare conductivity and brightness in open and closed water loops.","Measure brightness, residual ink and tensile strength on the same sample.","Compare a higher-yield stage that worsens quality."],"pitfalls":["以濕重計產率會把水分當纖維。","將百分濃度直接代入分率公式會差100倍。","只追求無紙片可能犧牲纖維強度。","排渣率提高可能增加纖維損失而非只去雜質。","氣泡過小並非無條件更好，可能增加水與纖維夾帶。","沿用不同油墨的k會錯估去除。","將所有浮渣都當油墨會高估選擇性。","只降低新水量可能使溶解污染累積。","漂白變亮不代表所有油墨已被分離。","只最佳化一段可能把負擔轉移到後段。"],"pitfallsEn":["Wet-mass yield counts water as fiber.","Using percent as fraction introduces a hundredfold error.","Eliminating every flake may sacrifice fiber strength.","More rejects can mean more fiber loss, not just contaminant removal.","Smaller bubbles are not unconditionally better and may increase entrainment.","Using k from another ink misestimates removal.","Treating all froth solids as ink overstates selectivity.","Lower freshwater alone can accumulate dissolved contaminants.","Brighter bleaching does not mean ink has been physically separated.","Optimizing one stage can shift the burden downstream."],"sourceIds":["v17s-urban-flotation","v17s-urban-dip"],"sources":[{"id":"v17s-urban-flotation","title":"廢紙浮選脫墨","titleEn":"Flotation","url":"https://www.voith.com/corp-en/papermaking___flotation.html","organization":"Voith","accessed":"2026-10-23","publisher":"Voith","scope":"來源支持原理或工程背景；算例為明示教學假設。","scopeEn":"Source supports principles or project context; examples use explicit teaching assumptions."},{"id":"v17s-urban-dip","title":"廢紙回收製漿流程","titleEn":"BlueLine DIP-process","url":"https://www.voith.com/corp-en/papermaking/blueline-dip-process.html","organization":"Voith","accessed":"2026-10-23","publisher":"Voith","scope":"來源支持原理或工程背景；算例為明示教學假設。","scopeEn":"Source supports principles or project context; examples use explicit teaching assumptions."}],"simulationOnly":true,"scope":"公開原理與資料支持的原創教學。算例中的輸入為明示教學假設，非該設施實測或操作設定。此處任務在離線模型完成，不能作為現場設計、飲用水合格或設備操作許可。","scopeEn":"Original teaching based on public principles and sources. Numerical inputs are explicit teaching assumptions, not site measurements or operating setpoints. Tasks use offline models and do not certify field design, potable-water compliance or equipment operation."}]}]},"related":{"courses":[{"courseId":"b470","overview":"跨單元連結與比較練習","overviewEn":"Cross-process connections and comparisons","related":[{"id":"b466","title":"垃圾自動真空收集","titleEn":"Automated vacuum waste collection","why":"比較兩個系統的物質或能量收支，列出不可直接沿用的邊界條件。","whyEn":"Compare material or energy balances and identify boundary conditions that cannot be transferred.","transfer":"守恆、量測與失效驗證","transferEn":"Conservation, measurement and failure verification","difference":"設備尺度、進料組成與品質目標必須分別設定。","differenceEn":"Equipment scale, feed composition and quality objectives require separate definitions.","practice":["各選一個教學算例，記下輸入、輸出與單位。","對照兩課的系統邊界，說明哪些假設不能沿用。","改變一個輸入，提出量測與失效判據來核對結果。"],"practiceEn":["Choose one worked example from each course and record inputs, outputs and units.","Compare system boundaries and identify assumptions that cannot transfer.","Change one input and propose measurements and failure criteria to check the result."],"place":{"name":"Envac斯德哥爾摩總部：方法資料來源機構（非實廠）","nameEn":"Envac global headquarters, Stockholm: methodology source institution (not a process plant)","country":"瑞典","countryEn":"Sweden","lat":59.33,"lon":18.05,"coordinateScope":"近似機構所在區域位置；依公開地址作教材地圖代表點，非建物入口、實廠、實測或導航位置。","coordinateScopeEn":"Approximate institution-area location inferred from its public address for the teaching map; not a building entrance, process plant, surveyed point or navigation coordinate.","locationSourceUrl":"https://www.envacgroup.com/contact/","locationVerified":"2026-10-23","lng":18.05},"referenceUrls":["https://www.epa.gov/sustainable-water-infrastructure/research-innovative-and-alternative-wastewater-technologies","https://www.epa.gov/smm","https://www.epa.gov/septic/wastewater-technology-fact-sheets"]},{"id":"b467","title":"資源回收廠光學分選","titleEn":"Optical sorting in materials recovery facilities","why":"比較兩個系統的物質或能量收支，列出不可直接沿用的邊界條件。","whyEn":"Compare material or energy balances and identify boundary conditions that cannot be transferred.","transfer":"守恆、量測與失效驗證","transferEn":"Conservation, measurement and failure verification","difference":"設備尺度、進料組成與品質目標必須分別設定。","differenceEn":"Equipment scale, feed composition and quality objectives require separate definitions.","practice":["各選一個教學算例，記下輸入、輸出與單位。","對照兩課的系統邊界，說明哪些假設不能沿用。","改變一個輸入，提出量測與失效判據來核對結果。"],"practiceEn":["Choose one worked example from each course and record inputs, outputs and units.","Compare system boundaries and identify assumptions that cannot transfer.","Change one input and propose measurements and failure criteria to check the result."],"place":{"name":"TOMRA阿斯克爾總部：方法資料來源機構（非實廠）","nameEn":"TOMRA headquarters, Asker: methodology source institution (not a process plant)","country":"挪威","countryEn":"Norway","lat":59.83,"lon":10.43,"coordinateScope":"近似機構所在區域位置；依公開地址作教材地圖代表點，非建物入口、實廠、實測或導航位置。","coordinateScopeEn":"Approximate institution-area location inferred from its public address for the teaching map; not a building entrance, process plant, surveyed point or navigation coordinate.","locationSourceUrl":"https://www.tomra.com/contact-us","locationVerified":"2026-10-23","lng":10.43},"referenceUrls":["https://www.epa.gov/sustainable-water-infrastructure/research-innovative-and-alternative-wastewater-technologies","https://www.epa.gov/smm","https://www.epa.gov/septic/wastewater-technology-fact-sheets"]}],"references":[{"id":"b-src-environment","title":"Research on Innovative and Alternative Wastewater Technologies","url":"https://www.epa.gov/sustainable-water-infrastructure/research-innovative-and-alternative-wastewater-technologies","publisher":"U.S. Environmental Protection Agency","scope":"Category overview: wastewater technologies and treatment references. Not individual verification of every named environmental project."},{"id":"b-src-waste","title":"Sustainable Materials Management","url":"https://www.epa.gov/smm","publisher":"U.S. Environmental Protection Agency","scope":"Category overview: materials life cycles, waste prevention, recycling and recovery."},{"id":"b-src-wastewater","title":"Wastewater Technology Fact Sheets","url":"https://www.epa.gov/septic/wastewater-technology-fact-sheets","publisher":"U.S. Environmental Protection Agency","scope":"Category overview: disinfection, constructed wetlands, package plants, sewer technologies and treatment."},{"id":"v17s-urban-flotation","title":"廢紙浮選脫墨","titleEn":"Flotation","url":"https://www.voith.com/corp-en/papermaking___flotation.html","organization":"Voith","accessed":"2026-10-23","publisher":"Voith","scope":"來源支持原理或工程背景；算例為明示教學假設。","scopeEn":"Source supports principles or project context; examples use explicit teaching assumptions."},{"id":"v17s-urban-dip","title":"廢紙回收製漿流程","titleEn":"BlueLine DIP-process","url":"https://www.voith.com/corp-en/papermaking/blueline-dip-process.html","organization":"Voith","accessed":"2026-10-23","publisher":"Voith","scope":"來源支持原理或工程背景；算例為明示教學假設。","scopeEn":"Source supports principles or project context; examples use explicit teaching assumptions."}]}]},"places":{"courses":[{"courseId":"b470","place":{"name":"Voith海登海姆資料與研發場域：方法資料來源機構（非實廠）","nameEn":"Voith source and research location, Heidenheim: methodology source institution (not a process plant)","country":"德國","countryEn":"Germany","lat":48.68,"lon":10.15,"coordinateScope":"近似機構所在區域位置；依公開地址作教材地圖代表點，非建物入口、實廠、實測或導航位置。","coordinateScopeEn":"Approximate institution-area location inferred from its public address for the teaching map; not a building entrance, process plant, surveyed point or navigation coordinate.","locationSourceUrl":"https://www.voith.com/corp-en/about-us/markets-locations/germany/heidenheim.html","locationVerified":"2026-10-23","lng":10.15},"summary":"本課以來源所列的技術指引與研究為閱讀脈絡，並非重建某一設施的工程沿革；算例、數據與場景參數皆為原創教學假設。比較舊方法與感測、控制、資源回收整合的方法時，先固定處理功能及系統邊界，再評估效率與可靠度。","summaryEn":"The cited technical guidance and research provide a reading pathway, not the engineering history of a particular facility. Examples, data and scene parameters are original teaching assumptions. When comparing conventional methods with integrated sensing, control and resource recovery, hold the treatment function and system boundary fixed before assessing efficiency and reliability.","history":[{"year":"工程背景","title":"廢紙脫墨處理","titleEn":"Deinking of recovered paper","text":"本課以來源所列的技術指引與研究為閱讀脈絡，並非重建某一設施的工程沿革；算例、數據與場景參數皆為原創教學假設。比較舊方法與感測、控制、資源回收整合的方法時，先固定處理功能及系統邊界，再評估效率與可靠度。","textEn":"The cited technical guidance and research provide a reading pathway, not the engineering history of a particular facility. Examples, data and scene parameters are original teaching assumptions. When comparing conventional methods with integrated sensing, control and resource recovery, hold the treatment function and system boundary fixed before assessing efficiency and reliability."}],"connection":"以「纖維解離、油墨浮選與水循環」為主線，依序完成十個專題單元。學徒在場景中辨識設備、列出邊界、重算明示的教學算例、比較量測與模型，最後診斷故障並交付證據。每一單元保留機制、算例、驗證與失效四種學習任務。","connectionEn":"Follow fiber liberation, ink flotation and water circulation through ten technical units. Identify equipment in the scene, define boundaries, reproduce explicitly hypothetical examples, compare measurements with models, and diagnose faults before handing over evidence. Each unit contains mechanism, calculation, verification and failure tasks.","references":[{"id":"v17s-urban-flotation","title":"廢紙浮選脫墨","titleEn":"Flotation","url":"https://www.voith.com/corp-en/papermaking___flotation.html","organization":"Voith","accessed":"2026-10-23","publisher":"Voith","scope":"來源支持原理或工程背景；算例為明示教學假設。","scopeEn":"Source supports principles or project context; examples use explicit teaching assumptions."},{"id":"v17s-urban-dip","title":"廢紙回收製漿流程","titleEn":"BlueLine DIP-process","url":"https://www.voith.com/corp-en/papermaking/blueline-dip-process.html","organization":"Voith","accessed":"2026-10-23","publisher":"Voith","scope":"來源支持原理或工程背景；算例為明示教學假設。","scopeEn":"Source supports principles or project context; examples use explicit teaching assumptions."}],"sourceIds":["v17s-urban-flotation","v17s-urban-dip"]}]},"vendors":{"courses":[],"vendors":[]}}};
